         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### How to Play\n\nTwo numbers appear: A on the left and B on the right. Is B greater than A?\n\n**Tip:** the open side of the comparison symbol always faces the larger number.\n\nIn the last two levels the gap is huge, so we use ≫ (much greater) and ≪ (much less).",
